[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0391","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0391.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0206","title":"Sendmail 8.8.0 MIME 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"sendmail 8.8.0 及 8.8.1 版本在处理 MIME 邮件消息时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器发送特制的 MIME 格式邮件触发溢出，覆盖内存数据，最终获取 root 权限。受影响的 sendmail 版本被广泛部署于各类 Unix/Linux 系统中，危害极大，CVSS 评分为 10.0。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0206"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:54Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.8.2 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 8.8.2 中修复。如无法立即升级，可禁用 MIME 解析功能或在邮件网关层面过滤畸形 MIME 消息作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0206"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0391.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1244","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0961","title":"惠普 HPUX sysdiag 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX sysdiag 实用程序在创建日志文件时存在符号链接竞争条件漏洞，本地攻击者可利用竞争条件创建指向敏感系统文件的符号链接，诱使 sysdiag 以 root 权限写入任意文件，从而实现本地权限提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响包含 sysdiag 组件的 HP-UX 操作系统版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，通过预先创建指向关键系统文件的符号链接，诱导 sysdiag 在日志创建过程中跟随链接并以 root 权限覆盖关键文件，实现权限提升。CVSS 评分 6.2，属于中等严重程度本地提权漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0961"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-09-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:24Z","remediation":"立即移除 sysdiag 相关程序的 setuid root 权限：执行 `chmod u-s /bin/sysdiag /usr/bin/sysdiag`。安装 HP 官方补丁 PHSS_7587（HP-UX 9.05）及对应 9.04 补丁。如无法打补丁，限制只有授权管理员可执行诊断工具，并监控 /tmp 目录下的符号链接攻击行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167419906&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/184a5a0fb7dfcbb1c5bcfd5178078c78dc1e4738/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0961.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0961","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0961.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/95eeda559fd899397df50f658cf25cf01bb1e4ea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0961.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b1565557a8e0fb04634f0989d7e7dd7febd4847/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4r7f-px9v-848g/GHSA-4r7f-px9v-848g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0961.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000104.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0259","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0259.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0116","title":"多种厂商 TCP/IP SYN Flood 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"TCP SYN Flood 是一种经典的拒绝服务攻击方式，攻击者利用 TCP 三次握手机制，向目标服务器发送大量伪造源地址的 SYN 请求包，服务器为每个请求分配资源并返回 SYN+ACK 包，但因无法收到最终的 ACK 确认包而导致连接半开状态持续占用系统资源，最终耗尽服务器连接队列，导致正常用户无法访问服务。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 3.2.5/4.1/4.2 等早期操作系统版本，攻击者无需认证即可发起攻击，是网络层拒绝服务攻击的典型代表。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0116"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-09-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:37Z","remediation":"启用 TCP SYN Cookies（如 Linux 设置 net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies=1）；缩短 SYN 超时时间（如设置 net.ipv4.tcp_synack_retries=1）；增大半连接队列（如设置 net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog=1024）。AIX 系统应安装对应补丁程序 APAR IX73380，并在边界防火墙上限制单位时间内新连接速率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/136","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/343","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0116.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0116","https://github.com/nbrito/research/blob/f070ce78f917d962de8df74cc7a841f1cbbcfa00/ddos/1996/CVE-1999-0116/README.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0116.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0116.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0116.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qfp8-p689-pjw7/GHSA-qfp8-p689-pjw7.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2009/CVE-2009-2318.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-2007-6040.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0259.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1459","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1459.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1295","title":"Transarc DCE Distributed File System (DFS) 权限许可和访问控制漏洞","description":"Transarc DCE Distributed File System (DFS) 1.1 for Solaris 2.4 及 2.5 版本存在权限许可和访问控制漏洞。当用户属于大量用户组时，系统未能正确初始化组列表（grouplist），导致这些用户可能获得本不应被授权的 DFS 保护资源的访问权限。攻击者可利用该漏洞越权访问受限文件资源，影响系统数据安全。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1295"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-09-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:08Z","remediation":"立即联系 Transarc（后为 IBM 收购）获取 DFS 1.1 的补丁版本，或升级至 DFS 1.1 后续维护版本。同时建议将 Solaris 2.4/2.5 升级至受支持的 Solaris 版本，并在 DFS 服务端配置文件中对用户组最大数量设置显式上限。当前该平台已停止支持，长期缓解措施为迁移至替代分布式文件系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/vendor_bulletins/VB-96.16.transarc","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7154","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1295.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1295","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1295.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1295.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wh9w-r7w5-38rf/GHSA-wh9w-r7w5-38rf.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87838/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1295.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/cmjayasinghe/Threat-Intelligence-Dashboard/blob/ccfec8014cc85c9e776b8f657bdb7879139ab5ed/data/cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1459.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1486","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1486.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1383","title":"GNU bash 及 tcsh 通配符扩展本地权限提升漏洞","description":"tcsh 和 bash 在处理包含 shell 元字符（反引号 `）的目录名时存在权限提升漏洞。当 shell 使用 PS1 环境变量中的 \\w 选项展开文件名时，目录名中嵌入的恶意命令会被执行。本地攻击者可创建包含反引号的目录名，诱导特权用户进入该目录触发命令执行，从而获取更高权限。该漏洞影响 tcsh 6.05 及 bash 1.14.7 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1383"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-09-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:19Z","remediation":"升级 tcsh 至 6.06 及以上版本，升级 bash 至 1.14.7 及以上版本（现代版本如 bash 4.x/5.x 均不受影响）。如无法立即升级，在 tcsh 的 .cshrc 中将 prompt 设置中移除 %/ 或 %~ 变量，在 bash 的 .bashrc 中将 PS1 变量中的 \\w（长路径）替换为 \\W（仅当前目录名）或移除之，避免 shell 在显示提示符时展开含反引号目录名中的命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167419868&w=2","http://www.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1996_3/0503.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1383.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1383","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1383.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1383.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-22f8-7h52-6pfg/GHSA-22f8-7h52-6pfg.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--45f95fa7-8948-43f0-9209-71f8181272f2.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1383.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/0a362f4f57e067cbdfd1de47d6fffa5dd1479d2e/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1486.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0281","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0281.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0131","title":"Sendmail Sendmail 缓冲区溢出本地提权漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.7.5 及更早版本在处理 GECOS 字段时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 GECOS 字段提交超长输入触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务或获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响运行 Sendmail 的 FreeBSD 等 Unix 系统，攻击者需拥有本地账户，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0131"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-09-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:39Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.8.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 8.8.0 中修复。缓解措施：在 /etc/sendmail.cf 中限制本地用户通过 GECOS 字段注入恶意数据，并限制不可信用户的本地访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/717"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0281.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1427","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1427.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1252","title":"SCO UnixWare 系统调用本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 2.0.x 及 2.1.0 版本中某个系统调用存在权限许可与访问控制漏洞。本地攻击者可通过利用该系统调用的访问控制缺陷，绕过权限限制访问任意文件，并获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于系统调用未能正确验证用户权限，属于本地提权类漏洞，攻击者需拥有本地登录权限。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1252"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-09-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:02Z","remediation":"SCO UnixWare 2.0.x 和 2.1.0 已停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即迁移至受支持的现代操作系统（如 Linux 或受支持的商业 Unix）。作为临时缓解措施，可限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许受信任的管理员账户访问系统，并严格审计系统调用日志以检测异常提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/vendor_bulletins/VB-96.15.sco","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1966","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e25ede9c3545efaa8ff0b393e30e48edb07502a8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1252.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1252","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1252.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/248c2167e720df96125f6ac9925793063a207510/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1252.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-xc79-p7j8-4x45/GHSA-xc79-p7j8-4x45.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87770/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1252.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--27319c0d-475c-4db7-b2fc-7a15fd182d60.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1427.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0538","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0538.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0324","title":"HP HP-UX ppl 本地符号链接提权漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 ppl（打印优先级限制）程序存在符号链接竞争条件漏洞。当 ppl 程序以 root 权限处理临时文件时，未安全地验证符号链接指向，拥有本地系统账户的攻击者可通过预先创建符号链接，诱导该程序以 root 身份写入或覆盖任意系统文件，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，影响 HP-UX 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高危。HP 已发布安全补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0324"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:09Z","remediation":"立即安装 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX9702-053 中针对受影响 HP-UX 版本（如 10.x/11.x）的对应补丁。若无法立即打补丁，可临时移除 ppl 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/ppl），阻止普通用户以 root 权限运行该程序作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9702-053"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0538.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1471","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1471.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1309","title":"Sendmail 调试模式操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.6.7 之前版本中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 debug（-d）命令行选项传入超大的数值参数触发该漏洞，利用 Sendmail 以 root 权限执行任意命令，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Sendmail 8.6.7 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。厂商已发布新版本修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 Sendmail 8.6.7 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1309"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-08-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sendmail 至 8.6.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 -d 调试选项缓冲区溢出导致本地提权的问题。如无法升级，可限制非 root 用户执行 Sendmail 的 setuid 权限，移除 sendmail 的 setuid root 位（chmod u-s /usr/lib/sendmail），并限制对 -d 调试选项的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-94.12.sendmail.vulnerabilities","http://www.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_1/0040.html","http://www.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_1/0042.html","http://www.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_1/0043.html","http://www.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_1/0048.html","http://www.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_1/0078.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7155","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1309.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1309","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1309.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1309.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8vf6-c57g-m574/GHSA-8vf6-c57g-m574.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/sendmail_long_debug.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1309.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000098.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d45cc933-5518-4d69-b8c3-51ab88d18fb0.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1471.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1383","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1383.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1187","title":"华盛顿大学 Pine 符号链接攻击权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统上的 Pine 邮件客户端在 3.94 及更早版本中存在权限提升漏洞。当用户收到新邮件时，Pine 会创建一个临时锁文件，但程序未对该锁文件进行严格校验，本地攻击者可通过预先创建指向敏感文件的符号链接来实施攻击，利用该 symlink race condition 覆盖或篡改系统文件，从而获取高于当前用户的系统权限。该漏洞仅影响拥有本地登录权限的攻击者，需目标系统运行受影响版本的 Pine 客户端才可被利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1187"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-08-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:54Z","remediation":"立即升级Pine邮件客户端到3.94或更高版本以修复CVE-1999-1187漏洞，建议在FreeBSD系统上使用`pkg update && pkg upgrade pine`命令。升级后，还需要检查是否存在锁文件权限配置不当的问题，建议将锁文件权限设置为600以防止其他用户写入。通过这两个措施既能修复代码中的符号链接漏洞，又能提供额外的权限保护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167419803&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/416","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf63c766a0e51c24a528a42a3e26e4fdf58db9e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1187.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1187","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1187.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/08f8d33c39c79a3a93a8b5c441facde3f9e3cc7d/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1187.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rvv4-ghr7-fw82/GHSA-rvv4-ghr7-fw82.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88936/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1187.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--88ce9761-df91-4cb2-b6e1-5b5987711269.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1383.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1383.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0201","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0085","title":"IBM AIX rwhod 远程缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"AIX 及其他类 Unix 操作系统中的 rwhod 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送包含超长主机名的特制 UDP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 AIX、FreeBSD 等多款操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。该漏洞属于经典的远程缓冲区溢出问题，攻击者只需构造恶意 UDP 报文即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0085"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-08-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:32Z","remediation":"立即禁用 rwhod 服务（命令：`killall rwhod` 并注释 /etc/inetd.conf 中 rwhod 行），若确需使用 rwhod，请升级 AIX 至 4.3.3 以上或 FreeBSD 至 3.2 以上版本。同时在防火墙上阻止外部对 UDP 端口 513 的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/118","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/119"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0201.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0282","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0282.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0132","title":"HP HP-UX Expreserve 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"HP-UX 系统中 vi 和 ex 编辑器调用的 expreserve 工具未对文件路径进行充分校验，存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可利用编辑器暂存文件机制，将缓存内容写入系统任意文件，覆盖关键配置文件或可执行程序，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，但需本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0132"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-08-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:39Z","remediation":"立即安装 HP 当时发布的安全补丁（HP-UX Security Patch 针对 vi/expreserve 组件）。如无法安装补丁，可临时移除 Expreserve 程序的 setuid 位：执行 chmod u-s /usr/lib/expreserve（或系统对应路径），以消除本地用户利用该漏洞进行提权的攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1996-19.html","http://www.osvdb.org/11723","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/401"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0282.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0283","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0283.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0133","title":"Adobe Framemaker fm_fls License Server 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Adobe Framemaker 的 fm_fls 许可证服务器存在任意文件写入漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该服务覆盖系统中任意文件，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞允许具有本地访问权限的用户通过发送特制请求修改关键系统文件，导致权限提升。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，攻击前提是拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0133"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:39Z","remediation":"升级 Adobe Framemaker 至厂商修复版本；若无法升级，立即移除 fm_fls 二进制文件的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /path/to/fm_fls），并严格限制可执行该二进制文件的用户组，仅授权给需要管理许可的信任用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0133"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0283.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0284","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0284.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0134","title":"Sun Solaris vold 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.x 系统中的卷管理守护进程 vold 存在权限漏洞，本地普通用户可利用该缺陷获取 root 超级用户权限。攻击者通过向 vold 发送特制请求或利用其在处理卷管理操作时权限检查不足的漏洞，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.x 系列操作系统，需拥有系统本地账户方可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0134"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-08-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:40Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 针对 Solaris 2.x 的 vold 安全补丁（Solaris 2.4 对应补丁 101945，Solaris 2.5/2.5.1 对应补丁 103600），升级至已修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可停止 vold 服务（/etc/init.d/volmgt stop）并禁用自动启动，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/8159"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0284.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1268","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1268.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1413","title":"Sun Solaris set-gid 程序 Core Dump 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.4 至 7.0 系统中 set-gid 程序存在核心转储权限检查缺陷，当真实用户 ID 不属于 set-gid 组时，set-gid 程序仍可生成 core dump 文件。本地攻击者可通过触发 set-gid 程序崩溃（例如利用 dmesg 命令）生成 core dump，从而以更高权限覆盖或创建任意文件，实现本地权限提升。CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1413"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-08-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:23Z","remediation":"安装 Solaris 2.4 kernel jumbo patch -35 或更新版本，限制 set-gid 程序在非特权用户下产生 core dump。可使用 coreadm(1M) 将 core 文件限制为只允许 root 读取，或通过 setuid(2) 在关键 set-gid 程序入口处禁用 core dump 生成。同时限制普通用户对 dmesg 等系统日志工具的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167419549&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/296","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19236","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1413.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1413","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1413.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-1413.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6v6p-c65q-8x22/GHSA-6v6p-c65q-8x22.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1413.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000093.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/296/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ac4ce242-c926-4c44-8a08-c1709e4c4139.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,